@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title Member Ready-Ring Retail Swimlane
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

|Guest or Member|
start
:Browse ready-ring catalogue;
:Select a ready ring;
if (Authenticated Member?) then (yes)
  :Review retail order and full payment due;
  :Start payment at Payment Gateway;
  |Payment Gateway|
  :Process full payment;
  |System|
  if (Valid gateway confirmation received?) then (yes)
    :Record verified full-payment transaction;
    :Create Retail Order;
    :Reserve one ready-ring unit;
    note right
    Reservation has no automatic expiry in V1.
    end note
    |Member|
    :Choose pickup or third-party delivery handoff;
    if (Pickup?) then (yes)
      |System|
      :Show pickup-ready / shop-preparation status;
    else (third-party handoff)
      |Staff / Consultant|
      :Hand order to third-party carrier;
      :Record carrier, handoff reference,\nStaff actor and timestamp;
      |System|
      :Show handed-to-carrier status;
    endif
    |Email Sender|
    :Deliver order/status notification;
    |System|
    :Store order and payment in Member history;
  else (no: pending / failed)
    :Show unconfirmed-payment status;
    :Do not reserve the ready ring;
  endif
else (no)
  |System|
  :Block retail checkout;
  :Offer sign in or Member registration;
endif

note right
V1 has no carrier API, live tracking, delivery failure, return or shipping-refund workflow.
end note
stop
@enduml
